
Ranger Help for: glevels
========================

SUMMARY:    
Rangers do not raise their guild level in the same way as most guilds do.
As a Ranger raises his or her game level, their guild level goes up as well.
The reason being is, a Ranger doesn't go and train to be a Ranger...they
must live and learn and as a Ranger grows(increases game level), they're
potential in the ways of a Ranger goes up. Which translates into gaining
slots. Slots, along with experience, are used to buy skills. It is possible
for a Ranger to gain multiple guild levels per game level, but only 
experienced and wise Rangers will benefit from this.

=============================================================================
